FFmpeg minimal cross-build (audio playback) for Rhythmc maker

Version:  6.1.1 (official FFmpeg source)
Build:    cross-compiled for Windows x64 (mingw-w64) with static SDL2, audio-only
License:  LGPL v2.1-or-later (built without --enable-gpl)
Source:   https://ffmpeg.org/releases/ffmpeg-6.1.1.tar.xz   (SDL2: libsdl.org / MSYS2)

Why this binary exists
----------------------
The previous bundled ffplay was a 64.5 MB FFmpeg 4.2.2 full static build. Rhythmc
maker only uses ffplay to play chart audio and apply pitch/speed changes
(`-nodisp ... -af volume,aresample,asetrate`),
so a minimal 6.1.1 build shrinks it to ~4.3 MB. This also aligns ffplay with the
bundled ffprobe (previously the two were different FFmpeg versions).

Rebuild
-------
tools/ffmpeg-minimal/build.sh builds both ffprobe.exe and ffplay.exe.
See tools/ffmpeg-minimal/README.md.
